{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>THIS DEMO OF <strong>LOVE ETERNAL</strong> FEATURES ONE SEGMENT OF THE EARLY GAME, KNOWN AS THE &quot;UNDERCASTLE&quot;. THE FULL GAME DESCRIPTION FOLLOWS.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, and reverse the flow of gravity itself to escape the mind of a selfish god in this challenging precision platformer. Play as Maya, a child stolen from her family on the whim of a lonely, forsaken deity, and make your way through over 100 screens filled with spikes, lasers, switches, and traps as you unravel the horrifying secret of your new prison. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973960/extras/303857bc77cf384eba3bcf964e7f8996.poster.avif?t=1759516337\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973960/extras/303857bc77cf384eba3bcf964e7f8996.webm?t=1759516337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gorgeous hand-drawn pixel art graphics bring the god\u2019s realm to life alongside meticulously handcrafted animations boasting many thousands of frames </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A lush, atmospheric score, equal parts unsettling and beautiful </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Responsive, snappy controls provide challenges with a sense of mastery and acrobatic accomplishment </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A psychological horror narrative contorts and unfolds to reveal choices beyond comprehension </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973960/extras/b17dac08e69c518fd74f7e8213da1a34.poster.avif?t=1759516337\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973960/extras/b17dac08e69c518fd74f7e8213da1a34.webm?t=1759516337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you find your way home, or wander these halls carved of memory forever?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3973960?t=1759516337","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973960/04fd8b49cdb0e54e41498c78c467779142767719/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759516337","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973960/84815c4ae297596447174466b1022db56d63a10b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759516337","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973960/84815c4ae297596447174466b1022db56d63a10b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759516337","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Love Eternal is a horror game which contains occasional, brief moments of unsettling imagery, in a stylised pixel art format."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>THIS DEMO OF <strong>LOVE ETERNAL</strong> FEATURES ONE SEGMENT OF THE EARLY GAME, KNOWN AS THE &quot;UNDERCASTLE&quot;. THE FULL GAME DESCRIPTION FOLLOWS.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, and reverse the flow of gravity itself to escape the mind of a selfish god in this challenging precision platformer. Play as Maya, a child stolen from her family on the whim of a lonely, forsaken deity, and make your way through over 100 screens filled with spikes, lasers, switches,